# evidence-brief environment. Copy to .env (gitignored) or set these in your
# shell or User environment. Names only — never commit a value.
#
# The CLI needs ONE model key. Everything else is optional and makes searching
# or full-text retrieval work better.

# ---- model (one of these) -------------------------------------------------
# OpenRouter is the default provider. CLI default model: anthropic/claude-opus-5.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Direct Anthropic API. Opt in with ARTICLEGEN_PROVIDER=anthropic.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# openrouter | anthropic | claude-cli (claude-cli uses your signed-in `claude`).
# ARTICLEGEN_PROVIDER=

# ---- scholarly search and full text ---------------------------------------
# Same names paperfetch uses, so one User-env setting serves both. Without a
# Semantic Scholar key its keyless tier often answers 429 and is skipped.
# SEMANTIC_SCHOLAR_API_KEY=
# NCBI_API_KEY=
# CORE_API_KEY=
# A real contact address puts OpenAlex requests in its polite pool.
# OPENALEX_MAILTO=
# Contact address `papers` sends to Unpaywall. Read in this order: PAPERS_MAILTO,
# OPENALEX_MAILTO, UNPAYWALL_EMAIL. With none, full text falls back to Europe PMC.
# PAPERS_MAILTO=
# UNPAYWALL_EMAIL=
# The `papers` command, if it is not on PATH.
# ARTICLEGEN_PAPERS_CMD=
# Search cache: seconds to keep results (default 86400; 0 turns it off) and
# where to keep them (default ~/.articlegen).
# ARTICLEGEN_SEARCH_CACHE_TTL=
# ARTICLEGEN_CACHE_DIR=
# 0 skips the pre-flight probe of the scholarly APIs.
# ARTICLEGEN_SOURCE_PROBE=

# ---- web server (`articlegen web`, and the hosted backend) ----------------
# Set on a shared host so nothing is written to disk. Unset locally: drafts
# land in drafts/.
# ARTICLEGEN_STATELESS=1
# The host-paid key for public generation. Hosted drafts plan with GPT-5.6 Luna
# and write with Claude Sonnet 5.5, both fixed by the server.
# ARTICLEGEN_PUBLIC_OPENROUTER_KEY=
# Browser origins allowed to call the API (default *).
# ARTICLEGEN_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://bartholomewtj.github.io
# Draft requests per IP per hour, and across all visitors per hour. These are
# the spend cap on the public key.
# ARTICLEGEN_RATE_LIMIT=20
# ARTICLEGEN_RATE_LIMIT_TOTAL=120
# Drafts the server runs at once as background jobs (default 4).
# ARTICLEGEN_MAX_JOBS=4
# Trust X-Forwarded-For behind your own proxy (Render is detected).
# ARTICLEGEN_TRUST_PROXY=
# Gist token (gist scope only) for the public gallery, and a secret gist id
# for the optional run log.
# ARTICLEGEN_GALLERY_TOKEN=
# ARTICLEGEN_ANALYTICS_GIST=
